      <author>Synty Studios</author>
      <link>https://humblebundle.com//software/best-synty-game-dev-assets-bundle-6-software</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">2b456ec8275ec717d0fc84f8822edfde55742f74</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/73b79f494ce69eabc085d395e3fcd65721813d45.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=a2d2c67fbdfed9de9baac1cc188354ed"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a19f040608cd25d712920bc835e8a491ec5cd2f2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=68fdf385e2b6d05299e967e99319585c"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Scene setting assets by Synty Studios&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Game developers, rejoice! The pros at Synty Studios are back to help you take your project from concept to chart‑topping hit with our latest Software Bundle. Build your worlds with professional‑quality assets—we’re talking massive polygon prototype packs, particle FX packs, and Viking realms. Or add complex interfaces or simple shopping malls and stores—anything you need to help bring your dream game to life. You’ll even get a $10 voucher to the Synty Studios store to keep creating. Save big and do good for others by supporting Doctors Without Borders with your purchase! &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys expire. Please redeem your keys before October 31, 2027. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $30 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#simple_buildings_syntystudios"&gt;Simple Buildings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#polygon_prototypepack"&gt;POLYGON - Prototype Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#polygon_shoppingplazamap"&gt;POLYGON - Shopping Plaza Map&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#polygon_particlefxpack"&gt;POLYGON - Particle FX Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#simplepropsanditemsandicons_cartoonassets"&gt;Simple Props/Items/Icons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#polygon_alpinemountain_naturebiome"&gt;POLYGON - Alpine Mountain - Nature Biome&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#animation_goblinlocomotion"&gt;ANIMATION - Goblin Locomotion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#interface_apocalypsehud"&gt;INTERFACE - Apocalypse HUD&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#polygon_vikingrealm"&gt;POLYGON - Viking Realm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#polygon_goblinwarcamp"&gt;POLYGON - Goblin War Camp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#polygon_shopspack"&gt;POLYGON - Shops Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#sidekickpack_goblinfighters"&gt;Sidekick Pack - Goblin Fighters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#10_voucher_bestsyntygamedevassetsbundle6_softwarebundle"&gt;$10 Voucher&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $30 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="simple_buildings_syntystudios"&gt;&lt;a id="simple_buildings_syntystudios"&gt;Simple Buildings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f105261115dfafca56b4b8db68bb47f26e153afd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2bbf017f179f78e70484d05b9cbc6dff"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synty® Studios presents: Simple Buildings    A simple asset pack of buildings to help create an urban, cartoon city based game. Mobile ready assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="polygon_prototypepack"&gt;&lt;a id="polygon_prototypepack" href="https://youtu.be/KAiun66iyBA"&gt;POLYGON - Prototype Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synty® Studios presents: POLYGON - Prototype Pack    With a diverse range of assets including characters, buildings, props, and environments, the POLYGON - Prototype Pack provides all the essentials you need to kickstart your game projects. Whether you're crafting a platformer, a shooter, an RPG, or something entirely unique, the modular nature of these assets allows for endless combinations and possibilities.    The ultimate collection for crafting prototypes, grey boxing demo scenes, and more. It includes diagnostic assets for teams to communicate design decisions using notes, markers and more. It's easy to try out ideas using the POLYGON style speed build blocks and primitives.    Key Features:  444 unique assets  10 alternative texture colors  Polygon and Simple Versions of building assets  Demo Scene included&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="polygon_shoppingplazamap"&gt;&lt;a id="polygon_shoppingplazamap" href="https://youtu.be/tro07839Ifc"&gt;POLYGON - Shopping Plaza Map&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synty® Studios presents: POLYGON - Shopping Plaza Map    This pack requires: POLYGON - Shops Pack (also included in the Best of Synty Game Dev Assets 6 Humble Bundle)    This map pack is an expansion add-on for POLYGON Shops Pack featuring a new demo scene, and a few new assets created for the new areas. Synty map packs are designed to help inspire you with level design, and save you time with pre-dressed areas ready to place into your project!    In this pack you will find a variety of new buildings including a boutique retail laneway, department store, cinema, coffee shop, supermarket, video game store, arcade, and pizzeria.    Key Features:  30+ new prefabs  9 poster and billboard textures  New buildings ready to place into your project  Generic assets folder with 350+ prefabs including buildings, props, environment, weapons, and FX&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="polygon_particlefxpack"&gt;&lt;a id="polygon_particlefxpack" href="https://youtu.be/Y3az8jkS0FU"&gt;POLYGON - Particle FX Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synty® Studios presents: POLYGON - Particle FX Pack    A particle FX asset pack including fire, water, smoke, dust, dirt, blood, nature, weapons, magic and more, to add to your POLYGON or low-poly style project.    Key Features:  - 120+ particle FX  - FX designed to complement the POLYGON asset series  - Lightweight particles to keep performance running smoothly&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="simplepropsanditemsandicons_cartoonassets"&gt;&lt;a id="simplepropsanditemsandicons_cartoonassets"&gt;Simple Props/Items/Icons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/69f76e1846afc00524c874b5230e805c3e134ee5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e8746e711c821d4f3ac7be55aeb91684"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synty® Studios Presents: Simple Props/Items/Icon    A Simple cartoon asset pack to help make your game worlds look lived in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="polygon_alpinemountain_naturebiome"&gt;&lt;a id="polygon_alpinemountain_naturebiome" href="https://youtu.be/lGdUup2xtaQ"&gt;POLYGON - Alpine Mountain - Nature Biome&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synty® Studios Presents: POLYGON - Alpine Mountain - Nature Biome    Explore this canvas of vibrant hues, from the rich greens of pine trees to the fiery reds, all harmoniously set against the backdrop of snow-capped summits.    This 3D low poly asset pack contains not only various prefabs, environment materials and textures but also a detailed demo scene, allowing you to add to or build out diverse landscapes in your game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="animation_goblinlocomotion"&gt;&lt;a id="animation_goblinlocomotion" href="https://youtu.be/_HlCXThMGos"&gt;ANIMATION - Goblin Locomotion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synty® Studios presents: ANIMATION - Goblin Locomotion    A specialised animation pack delivering a dynamic range of movements for your goblin characters.    Watch your goblin characters leap (or stumble) into action with vibrant, expressive motions that inject energy and creativity into your gameplay, elevating both the characters and the world they inhabit.    Featuring high quality locomotion animations with each state meticulously crafted. This set comes complete with multiple animations and smooth transitions, offering a versatile collection of movement to bring your goblins to life with fluidity and personality.    Dive into the Mecanim Animation Controllers included in this pack and unlock a treasure trove of knowledge on setting up animation states, transitions, blend trees, and parameters. Whether you're a seasoned pro or an aspiring developer, our resources provide the perfect launchpad for crafting your own unique animation controller.    Key Features:  398 animation clips, including POLYGON and Sidekicks variants, as separate files allowing you to selectively import the animations you need into your project  Character controller example scripts  Mecanim animation controller  Demo scenes to test the animations  Gallery scenes with all the animations laid out  POLYGON and Sidekicks crash dummy characters, fully rigged and animated  Built for Unity, FBX files included  Polygon and Sidekick crash dummy model and animation controller demo scenes included!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="interface_apocalypsehud"&gt;&lt;a id="interface_apocalypsehud" href="https://youtu.be/YyR0c3j_OPo"&gt;INTERFACE - Apocalypse HUD&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synty® Studios Presents: INTERFACE - Apocalypse HUD    Quickly build out your game HUD with dozens of pre-built HUD elements cobbled together from rusted metal and salvaged electronic components. Action bars, minimaps, compasses, weapon wheels, HP bars, damage FX, crosshairs - we’ve added everything we could think of to help you quickly assemble a quality-looking, responsive HUD. Each component can be visually customized to suit your game’s needs, whether you’re making an ultra-minimal survival game or an apocalyptic ARPG.    Key Features:  Over 160 prefabs (with animations!). Easily piece together a unique UI with customisable components.  Seamlessly blend your game's UI with gameplay by using the 650+ icons included. Icons of props and weapons are rendered from items and weapons found in the POLYGON - Apocalypse Pack.  Customisable visual variants for components allows your to add your own style to your game's HUD. You can create hundreds of variations to fit your specific game's needs.  Comprehensive range of input icons for multiple controller types easily lets you support PC, Xbox, PS, and Switch!  Artistically blends with existing Synty asset packs. We've designed the UI to match Synty's POLYGON style. Your game will look sleek and professionally made with a UI that matches your games 3D aesthetic.  Text and numeric buttons can be tinted, localised and customised    *The UI elements contained in this pack are 2D and intended to work with Unity's UGUI and 2D systems. No 3D models are included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="polygon_vikingrealm"&gt;&lt;a id="polygon_vikingrealm" href="https://youtu.be/YoJ4_SZNwzU"&gt;POLYGON - Viking Realm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synty® Studios presents: POLYGON - Viking Realm    Nestled amongst the fjords, discover an ancient Viking Realm! A village of brave seafarers and hardened adventurers living boldly among the snow capped mountains.    Within this pack you’ll find pieces of the old world, including boats, carved houses, and monuments to the gods, designed to instil a sense of adventure into your game.    Key Features:  600+ unique prefabs  Custom shaders including water, snow, and aurora  Modular building system  10 characters, rigged and ready for animation  Includes generic assets folder with over 285 prefabs of buildings, props, env, weapons, and FX&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="polygon_goblinwarcamp"&gt;&lt;a id="polygon_goblinwarcamp" href="https://youtu.be/g5U-kk9woAY"&gt;POLYGON - Goblin War Camp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synty® Studios presents: POLYGON - Goblin War Camp    In a festering swamp, surrounded by makeshift walls reinforced with wood, hide, bone and scraps, lies the Goblin War Camp. You trudge through the stronghold amid their preparations for war, but beware, goblins don’t care for outsiders...    Fires burn in pits, casting flickering shadows, while the fierce horde ready their weapons ahead of the next battle. Structures are haphazardly arranged, some elevated on stilts above the festering swamp. The air is heavy with the smell of damp earth, smoke, and sweat.    Key Features:  600+ premium prefabs / blueprints  Unique complete buildings / structures  15 characters, rigged and ready for animation  Includes a swampy goblin stronghold demo scene&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="polygon_shopspack"&gt;&lt;a id="polygon_shopspack" href="https://youtu.be/9VLkEVzFHOI"&gt;POLYGON - Shops Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synty® Studios presents: POLYGON - Shops Pack    A low poly asset pack of modular buildings, characters, props and environment assets to create a shop themed polygonal style game. 1,900+ detailed prefabs are included with this pack!    Key Features:  Fully modular buildings!  Loads of food, items and props perfect for VR!  Huge variation of shelves, counters, tables and seating!  Karen!  Includes a shopping mall demo scene&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sidekickpack_goblinfighters"&gt;&lt;a id="sidekickpack_goblinfighters"&gt;Sidekick Pack - Goblin Fighters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e99164a36f38cf6fb8b92ffef00e7bafda122bba.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f53023436a796da4544f5a1d421776b9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Synty Studios presents: Goblin Fighters – Sidekick Modular Characters    Gear up for battle with 300+ character parts including helmets, weapons, armour, and more, designed to deliver the menacing fighters your project needs. Create a wide variety of customised goblin fighter characters designed to suit your project! Unleash your creativity or utilise our expert presets.     Pack Content Features:  300+ modular, rigged Goblin Fighter Parts (masks, armour, weapons, and more)  90+ modular, rigged goblin base species parts (torsos, legs, hands, feet etc.)  Fully rigged to the Unity Humanoid skeleton (Mecanim compatible)  Unreal Engine Mannequin compatible  Dynamic joints allow you to add realistic motion to capes, hair, beards etc.  Facial blend shapes for expressions and lipsync (works with ARKit)  Body blend shapes to adjust body type and proportions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="10_voucher_bestsyntygamedevassetsbundle6_softwarebundle"&gt;&lt;a id="10_voucher_bestsyntygamedevassetsbundle6_softwarebundle"&gt;$10 Voucher&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6f58175173158df0bb532caae516670080bff66a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d07d2dc6ff4475a5402ee493512734be"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;US$10 voucher to use on the Synty Store checkout.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
