&gt;&lt;p&gt;This beginner-friendly video course takes you from your first prompt to practical projects. You’ll learn how to communicate clearly with GPT‑6 Astra, explore its core capabilities, and use it to build practical applications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Get started with GPT‑6 Astra.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Explore its reasoning, research, coding, and creation capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Turn your ideas into practical apps and workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build a text-to-speech app and more projects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a strong foundation now, and everything you create afterward becomes easier.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to every module.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to begin? Send your first prompt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="claudecertifieddeveloper_foundationsccdv-fwithpracticeexamfirst-ti"&gt;&lt;a id="claudecertifieddeveloper_foundationsccdv-fwithpracticeexamfirst-ti" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Claude Certified Developer - Foundations (CCDV-F) with Practice Exam (First-Time Exclusive Humble Bundle Release)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0a8c6545f4d636d94431993d32b98323be102385.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f9ad82c6031ed0821dd55d45cfe5650b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Want a developer credential for Claude? The CCDV-F is the foundations exam, and this video course walks you through it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Foundational Claude development concepts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► API basics and developer workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Exam topics explained in plain terms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Practice questions in the exam format.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The foundations tier is where Claude developer certification begins.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enroll Today!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="claudecertifiedassocia