fore the real thing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Architecture fundamentals for Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Foundational design and deployment concepts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Exam topic walkthroughs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Practice that mirrors the exam format.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Limited spots!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="claudecodeplusqwen36_buildlocalaicodingprojectswithanollamabackend"&gt;&lt;a id="claudecodeplusqwen36_buildlocalaicodingprojectswithanollamabackend" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Claude Code + Qwen 3.6: Build Local AI Coding Projects with an Ollama Backend&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b754a5abf0d5d872745099465659087806a4d89b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=46ff6329fb7d5fbeef1193d46141f13e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cloud AI is convenient until you want your code to stay on your machine. This video course sets up Claude Code with Qwen 3.6 running on a local Ollama backend.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll install Ollama, connect Claude Code, and build real projects, including a website generated from a single prompt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Installing Ollama and running your first conversation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Choosing models and useful terminal commands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building a website from one prompt, then improving it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Editing existing repositories with your local setup.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;By the end you'll have a working local AI coding stack and projects built with it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Set up your local stack and start building.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="modelcontextprotocolinllmproduction_scalableserverdeployment"&gt;&lt;a id="modelcontextprotocolinllmproduction_scalableserverdeployment" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Model Context Protocol in LLM Production - Scalable Server Deployment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8e55538022e4e6d924b4d7becb5492f7ef61268a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8b0df7459243e00594bf36f99f779521"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;MCP is how LLMs connect to tools and data. This video course takes you from the protocol basics to servers built for production.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll build servers and clients with the Python SDK, then cover transports, scaling, and debugging.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► MCP lifecycle, JSON-RPC 2.0, and core primitives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Registering tools with input schemas and structured results.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► stdio vs HTTP transports and when to use each.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Stateless HTTP configuration, debugging, and security.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll also cover sampling callbacks, roots, and exposing resources, plus the common issues that appear when moving from stdio to HTTP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deploy your first MCP server.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildagentskillsinclaudecode_automatewithai"&gt;&lt;a id="buildagentskillsinclaudecode_automatewithai" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Build Agent Skills in Claude Code - Automate with AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e6ba64d241324d2fbe0b6ee4fbf00dfe05c8c7c2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d4858a03e247e66663d00b40c5218246"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Skills turn Claude Code from a general assistant into one that works your way. This video course shows you how to build, configure, and share them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It starts with Claude Code setup for anyone new, then moves straight into skill creation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► What a skill is and how Claude Code uses it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building and installing a .skill file.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Configuring skill frontmatter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Adding extra resources, then sharing and deploying skills.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Once your skill is installed, that repeat task stops being yours.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildwithclaudecowork_automationwithaiagents"&gt;&lt;a id="buildwithclaudecowork_automationwithaiagents" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Build with Claude Cowork - Automation with AI Agents&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2e295b58325698a9724154cb1023cb1c1dd982be.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bf4e022731ef3340541db4332839e5a1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Claude Cowork is Anthropic's agent app for knowledge work. This video course covers setting it up and handing it real tasks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll run task loops, feed Cowork the right context, and automate research and analysis.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Setting up Cowork and running your first task loop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building context and instructions agents can follow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Automating research and analysis work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Plugins, scheduled tasks, and responsible use.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;By the end, recurring work runs on a schedule instead of on your calendar.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hand off your first task.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildappsinclaudedesign_aidevelopment"&gt;&lt;a id="buildappsinclaudedesign_aidevelopment" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Build Apps in Claude Design - AI Development&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7686d242f3cca5421b6c6a6b744a3d2bda44096a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=db0e9b861433e1c8b6f1592ea14a09e1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;You describe the app, Claude Design builds toward it. This video course covers the full workflow from first prompt to handoff.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll learn to prompt for layout, style, and app type, then iterate and export.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Writing design prompts for structure, style, and brand.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Iterating with chat, inline comments, and versions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Adding screenshots, codebases, and design files as context.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Exporting to Claude Code, Canva, and your organization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The course also walks through specific builds: dashboards, landing pages, forms, mobile flows, and internal tools, plus known limitations and pricing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build your first app.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="automatewithclaudecode_aicodingassistantwithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="automatewithclaudecode_aicodingassistantwithpracticeexam" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Automate with Claude Code - AI Coding Assistant with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1b9d0b4a85ad3d1eec0e7de63f2324fc2462de96.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0d927a36a1bcce728a40eae2d41d7a5f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Claude Code works from your terminal, and this course covers how to direct it well, from setup habits to shipping an app.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll learn how it thinks, then use it on real project work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► CLAUDE.md, context management, /clear and /compact, and usage costs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Fixing bugs, refactoring, adding features, and reviewing AI code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building an AI-powered app from planning to core features.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Deploying to the cloud with error logging and your first live fix.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It closes with when to use Claude Code, when not to, and a daily workflow you can keep.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Includes practice exam with unlimited attempts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don't miss out!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildescaperoomsinclaudedesign_3daigamedevelopment"&gt;&lt;a id="buildescaperoomsinclaudedesign_3daigamedevelopment" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Build Escape Rooms in Claude Design - 3D AI Game Development&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f031dddf1f9451f91e5bb2cd322eaf58a8d99fb6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b33cbb3fcca6f85615b99eaef209a1db"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;An escape room is a puzzle box you build yourself. In this video course you'll generate THREE.js escape rooms in Claude Design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll describe 3D scenes to an AI model and study what makes puzzles work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building a custom detective escape room.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Describing 3D scenes (the Clockmaker's Studio room).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Structural puzzle patterns in a Neanderthal room.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Puzzle mechanics in a Victorian plumbing room.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The final build covers narrative scaffolding with an office escape room.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join the herd!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildyourownagents_automatewithpythonandclaude"&gt;&lt;a id="buildyourownagents_automatewithpythonandclaude" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Build Your Own Agents - Automate with Python and Claude&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bfdae7d5935819e5cf3b1428a628b78b51f64b97.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f71c8fed9fd1b41f2b1daf7fcd0d004a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Agents are programs that take steps on their own. In this video course you'll build 3 of them with Python and Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each project adds a capability: research, file editing, then computer use.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► A research agent that accepts queries and stores responses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► A file-editing agent using LLM tool use and the Anthropic SDK.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Claude Computer Use in a Docker container.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► The agent loop behind the Computer Use demo app.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Source files are included for each project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Code your first agent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="financeagentdevelopmentbootcamp"&gt;&lt;a id="financeagentdevelopmentbootcamp" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Finance Agent Development Bootcamp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/80da9183cff0bea8d60a87ba1b11f34c5dab3b04.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3f747dadc7cf808eeebcaa5a0c2892b1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stock analysis and forecasting are repeatable, which makes them good agent work. This video bootcamp builds finance agents with Python and Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll work in Colab with the Anthropic SDK and live stock data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connecting to the Anthropic SDK on Colab.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Fetching stock data with a Python library.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Sending tool output to Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generating financial forecasts with a tools-based agent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Source files are included so you can follow along or adapt the projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build your finance agent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildlandingpagesinclaudedesign_aiforsales"&gt;&lt;a id="buildlandingpagesinclaudedesign_aiforsales" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Build Landing Pages in Claude Design - AI for Sales&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0a7f65710b9e81bd185b7d20abec5e11868b4f86.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a0f41e7637c74a131823df404d82cbd3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A landing page has one job: convert. This video course builds several in Claude Design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll create a page, edit it 3 ways, and fix the mobile view before moving to new page types.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Creating your first project in Claude Design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Manual edits, tweak edits, and prompt edits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Fixing the mobile view.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building cybersecurity and luxury fitness landing pages.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Two full page builds show how the same workflow adapts to different audiences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Launch a page this weekend.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="claudechatingodotwithrestapi"&gt;&lt;a id="claudechatingodotwithrestapi" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Claude Chat in Godot with REST API&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ce041384b4d3ecfd954ebea0e5b17992ddcd8e35.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3a448ebdb6b44b15411a9f045fcbef2d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Godot is free and open source, and Claude connects to it over REST. This video course puts the two together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's a hands-on build: set up the project, then connect to the API.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► What you'll need for Claude in Godot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building the Godot project for Anthropic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connecting to the Anthropic API.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Getting responses into your project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Short and focused, so you go from empty project to working connection quickly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add Claude to your Godot project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="claudechatbotintegrationinunrealengine5withrestapi"&gt;&lt;a id="claudechatbotintegrationinunrealengine5withrestapi" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Claude Chatbot Integration in Unreal Engine 5 with REST API&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2104f8ce4f7488f7014e17402d9dadaa2243c283.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=29c8887ac374323db8f49517aa49d475"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;UE5 plus a Claude chatbot: that's the build in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each step pairs an explanation with a hands-on lesson, and source files are included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Setting up a UE5 project for the Anthropic API.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► UE5 blueprints for API calls.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Getting and handling the Anthropic response in UE5.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Hands-on builds at every stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll finish with Claude responding inside your Unreal project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get Claude talking in your game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildanthropicclaudellmchatinunitywithrestapi"&gt;&lt;a id="buildanthropicclaudellmchatinunitywithrestapi" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Build Anthropic Claude LLM Chat in Unity with REST API&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2edb5c6676d1af092695b1f1785192ecebe99a49.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2c397016e0efee9c71ddeb77cef90acf"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unity developers, this video course connects Claude to your project through C# and REST.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Unity project setup for Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► C# REST API calls to the Anthropic API.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Writing the C# script for requests.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Parsing JSON responses and formatting output.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll end with a working LLM chat inside Unity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start the integration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="aiimageandvideogenerationinpythonstablediffusion_withstabilityaiandpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="aiimageandvideogenerationinpythonstablediffusion_withstabilityaiandpracticeexam" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;AI Image and Video Generation in Python Stable Diffusion with Stability AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0fc7640f059768f0e5b98eb326ad61ab6b98b4ff.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=681a7ccab17fcfc8d88be36d28732b89"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Generate images in code, then turn them into video. This video course uses the Stability Python SDK with Anthropic in the pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's project work from the first lesson.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generating an image with the Stability Python SDK.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Adding a system prompt to the project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Extracting from the Anthropic API response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generating video from an image.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;By the end you'll have a Python pipeline that goes from prompt to image to video.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Generate your first images.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="advancedclaudepromptengineering-innovateinvoyageaiwithpythonandpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="advancedclaudepromptengineering-innovateinvoyageaiwithpythonandpracticeexam" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Advanced Claude Prompt Engineering - Innovate in Voyage AI with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cd342e6507c8207bf485e4bf4b1f34971b5b369d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8d6776c129e98f4902a46decd444d493"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Embeddings are where prompt engineering gets technical. This video course covers why they matter and how to build with them using Voyage AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll work through the Python package, the HTTP API, and a practical application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Why prompt engineers need embeddings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Text embeddings with the Voyage Python package.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Accessing embeddings via the Voyage HTTP API.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Integrating Voyage AI embeddings with AWS.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A hands-on build with the Voyage Python SDK ties it together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Level up your prompts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildnewslettersinclaudedesign_aiemailmarketing"&gt;&lt;a id="buildnewslettersinclaudedesign_aiemailmarketing" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Build Newsletters in Claude Design - AI Email Marketing&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/62e0f25291df9ee20538f856bb61f8ae3cdd4792.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a4642efabb1f430cceab601c8f601a9e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Newsletters take time to design. This video course builds them in Claude Design, from brand setup to export.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll upload brand assets, prompt for structure and tone, and refine section by section.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Prompting for newsletter structure, audience, and variations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building hero sections, body blocks, CTAs, headers, and footers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Refining with chat edits and inline comments, plus version management.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Exporting as PDF or HTML, sending to Canva, and sharing internally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Three full projects close it out: a company announcement, a weekly digest, and a product launch newsletter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build your next issue.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildanimatedexplainersinclaudedesign_aimotion"&gt;&lt;a id="buildanimatedexplainersinclaudedesign_aimotion" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Build Animated Explainers in Claude Design - AI Motion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b243c851a4d7e8b024c1788cae16a9b5a15e3c0e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=59e05d33a011ee346e911da824e5384d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explainer videos usually need an animator. This video course makes them in Claude Design instead, voiceover included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll visualize abstract ideas, add captions, and generate AI voiceover, then build a range of explainer projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Video with AI voiceover and generated captions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Character-driven explainers and product launch teasers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Animated infographics and SaaS dashboard tours.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Vertical social video and mechanical animation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It closes with prompt engineering tips specific to Claude Design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Animate your first explainer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="promptengineeringforclaudellmwithanthropicapi-techniquesinpythonwithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="promptengineeringforclaudellmwithanthropicapi-techniquesinpythonwithpracticeexam" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Prompt Engineering for Claude LLM with Anthropic API - Techniques in Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9fc20032373c763157aac4e994e5b726f8fcbd4d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6f608ca19f12a35c7b3d532e12c8327a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start where every Claude developer starts: API keys and a first request. This video course covers the basics of prompting Claude through the Anthropic API in Python.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It keeps the scope tight so you build a correct foundation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Creating your API keys.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Sending your first API request.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► How the Anthropic API is structured.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Writing direct, clear prompts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Short by design, and everything after builds on it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Send your first request.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="claudechatbotpromptingstrategieswithanthropicapi"&gt;&lt;a id="claudechatbotpromptingstrategieswithanthropicapi" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Claude Chatbot Prompting Strategies with Anthropic API&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5af018234d1e406a7458371ae25146a8fbd3e7c1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=23450fd8dde2200fa7214a8af244a250"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Two hands-on builds, no filler. This video course covers chatting with Claude and formatting its output through the Anthropic Python SDK.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll work directly in code from the first lesson.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Chatting with Claude via the Anthropic Python SDK.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Formatting model output in Python.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Working with the SDK request and response cycle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Practical patterns you can reuse in your own scripts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A quick course for getting comfortable with the SDK.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pick up the SDK and follow along.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="promptconstructiontechniqueswithclaudeanthropicapiandpython"&gt;&lt;a id="promptconstructiontechniqueswithclaudeanthropicapiandpython" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Prompt Construction Techniques with Claude Anthropic API and Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/badf957de8dd872277fc13423711db17783af5c5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7d38700569f4042559c49f0243ae2489"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;How you build a prompt changes what comes back. This video course covers 3 construction techniques for Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each one solves a specific output problem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Prompting Claude for deliberate, step-by-step thought.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Few-shot prompting with examples.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Fixing hallucinations in chatbot responses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Applying each technique through the Anthropic API in Python.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3 techniques, each one immediately usable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Construct a better prompt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="advancedchatbotpromptingtechniqueswithclaudeanthropicapi"&gt;&lt;a id="advancedchatbotpromptingtechniqueswithclaudeanthropicapi" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Advanced Chatbot Prompting Techniques with Claude Anthropic API&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bcebedb4152e3517ed2a91277c1ac2671903a4d2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d833532da9c89b0356589111ce6e8ec3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Past the basics, prompting becomes engineering. This video course covers complex prompts, chaining, and tool use with Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every concept comes with a hands-on Python build.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Engineering complex prompts from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Chaining multiple prompts together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Function calling and tool use with Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Formatting results for Claude tools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hands-on lessons connect to the Anthropic API, chain prompts, and run function calls with the Python SDK.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join the experts!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="mastercomputervisionwithclaudeaipythonsdkandpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="mastercomputervisionwithclaudeaipythonsdkandpracticeexam" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Master Computer Vision with Claude AI Python SDK&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/981cb75daf0e34e9b905b2a01957636c49cfdd2a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4065ab311eda1c903839cdbe753bc405"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Claude can read images. This video course covers vision work with the Python SDK.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll send images to Claude and compare what it sees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Describing an image with the Claude Vision Python SDK.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Comparing multiple images in one request.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► What Claude Vision can and can't do.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building around vision output in Python.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don't miss this!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="transformdataintoinsights_aipdfanalysisanddatavisualizationinclaudepythonandmatplotlibwithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="transformdataintoinsights_aipdfanalysisanddatavisualizationinclaudepythonandmatplotlibwithpracticeexam" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;AI PDF Analysis and Data Visualization in Claude, Python and Matplotlib&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/397796e31ac1480585943564bac179309fa53f89.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7ceb53dbc850c5cfa889b96baa761b6f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;PDFs hold data nobody wants to extract by hand. This video course pulls information out with Claude and charts it with Matplotlib.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll go from raw PDF to generated visualization in Python.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Encoding PDFs to images for Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Extracting information from PDFs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generating Matplotlib code with Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Hands-on Pyplot generation with the Anthropic Python SDK.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One pipeline: document in, chart out.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoft365certified_copilotandagentadministrationfundamentalswit"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoft365certified_copilotandagentadministrationfundamentalswit" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Microsoft 365 Certified: Copilot and Agent Administration Fundamentals with Practice Exam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b5b66e8e81008b7c2e04de9f442d2bc75a96784d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5b2341057b6277f1f52c04d7c0c0cead"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Copilot is rolling out across Microsoft 365, and someone in your organization needs to understand how to manage it. This course covers the fundamentals of administering Copilot and AI agents within the Microsoft 365 environment, preparing you for both the certification and the real responsibility that comes with it.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;► Understand Copilot deployment within Microsoft 365&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;► Manage AI agents and their configurations&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;► Navigate governance, permissions, and compliance basics&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;► Prepare for the Microsoft Copilot administration certification As AI becomes a standard part of Microsoft 365, administrators who understand it will be the ones trusted to manage it.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;✅ Graded practice exam with unlimited attempts Get ahead of the curve and start here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="revolutionizingsaleswithclaudeai_in-depthtrainingwithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="revolutionizingsaleswithclaudeai_in-depthtrainingwithpracticeexam" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Revolutionizing Sales with Claude AI - In-Depth Training&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/eeb87d83f9a19a4c52af031f1d9fb890bf6c97cf.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4f1c43a19a63de882a266d64153cbd5e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sales runs on data, conversations, and process. This video course covers using Claude across all 3.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll apply Claude to the parts of sales that eat your week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Data-driven sales strategies with Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Improving customer interaction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Streamlining sales processes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Fitting Claude into your existing routine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;An assistant that handles drafting and analysis leaves you more time to sell.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Put Claude on your sales team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="claudeaiasanadvancedpersonalassistantwithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="claudeaiasanadvancedpersonalassistantwithpracticeexam" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Claude AI as an Advanced Personal Assistant&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e9318fb4c9a7a6e6a8dd0540e1309b2c09ac9931.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4e77c9c41e7d5faa2596d06e3c1c4427"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Beyond basic chat, Claude can run parts of your day. This video course covers communication, task management, and research support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll apply Claude to the coordination work that fills your calendar.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Facilitating communication, including multilingual and conflict resolution.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Schedule management and task delegation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Information gathering and research summarization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Decision-making assistance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The value shows up in the hours you get back each week.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make Claude part of your routine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="claudeaiindocumentanalysisandmanagementwithpracticeexam"&gt;&lt;a id="claudeaiindocumentanalysisandmanagementwithpracticeexam" href="https://youtu.be/Q8uCoUeSN5w"&gt;Claude AI in Document Analysis and Management&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/12edb684c57192d0f261fa4bc17544f27eb51c35.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=341e8712f9aa3cecca094f1b0a3d398d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Documents pile up faster than anyone reads them. This video course covers sorting, checking, and summarizing them with Claude.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll organize files, run compliance checks