      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c2c703130aac1415f81d3b2c3d12557d16ac4fc5.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=a1edfb3e5105de4c9891a8285a5c5a9c"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fd1fc07f04a47567806fb4bf9726e72d62171e05.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=552b5b541c0e3990eb0288ba0d7406c7"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Unlock premium spoken lines with Voice Vault&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get everything you need to create authentic, engaging characters who resonate with your players with Voice Vault: The Ultimate Collection of Human‑made Voice Lines. Choose from 100+ human voice recordings with over 600 professionally recorded lines from professional voices like Bryce Garland, D’laina Hunt, Hannah Weeks, Ntlanhla Kutu, and more. Pay what you want for subscription‑ and royalty‑free audio packs from the industry’s biggest and boldest voices, and help support Children’s Miracle Network with your purchase! &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Codes are redeemable through the Ovani website.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $30 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#voices_shortphrasesvoiceoverpack"&gt;Voices: Short Phrases Voice Over Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#voices_wordlessexpressionsvoiceoverpack"&gt;Voices: Wordless Expressions Voice Over Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#yourvoiceactor_brycegarlandvoiceoverpack"&gt;Your Voice Actor: Bryce Garland Voice Over Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#yourvoiceactor_dlainahuntvoiceoverpack"&gt;Your Voice Actor: D'laina Hunt Voice Over Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#yourvoiceactor_hannahweeksvoiceoverpack"&gt;Your Voice Actor: Hannah Weeks Voice Over Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#yourvoiceactor_liamreevesvoiceoverpack"&gt;Your Voice Actor: Liam Reeves Voice Over Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#yourvoiceactor_ntlanhlakutuvoiceoverpack"&gt;Your Voice Actor: Ntlanhla Kutu Voice Over Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#yourvoiceactor_reececoetzervoiceoverpack"&gt;Your Voice Actor: Reece Coetzer Voice Over Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#yourvoiceactor_rorychildsvoiceoverpack"&gt;Your Voice Actor: Rory Childs Voice Over Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $30 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="voices_shortphrasesvoiceoverpack"&gt;&lt;a id="voices_shortphrasesvoiceoverpack" href="https://youtu.be/Icy3xAXbFzY"&gt;Voices: Short Phrases Voice Over Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/aef02688df8cc6389ae4af655cf006fc2c6b101b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7936333caa08e6f3ac52861e0a894104"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click here to view the full list of voice lines in the Short Phrases Voice Over Pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Introduce a new level of immersion with the Short Phrases Voice Over Pack by Ovani Sound. This collection provides a diverse range of high-quality voice lines, recorded by real human voice actors Michael Smith and Simoné Oosthuizen - ensuring authentic, natural performances, and not AI or computer-generated voices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With a total of 190 finely tuned voice lines, this pack includes both male and female voices across various categories:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Affirmations: Boost character interactions with confident responses like "I got it," "I understand," and "Yes, I can do that." Ideal for task confirmations and supportive character feedback. Commands: Add authority and urgency to your scenes with commanding lines like "Chop chop," "Keep walking," and "Don’t go messing around." Perfect for leaders, guides, and assertive characters. Greetings: Set the tone with friendly welcomes and goodbyes such as "Hello there," "Have a nice day," and "Welcome to paradise." Great for NPCs, merchants, and approachable characters. Merchant: Bring your shopkeepers and traders to life with engaging lines like "Can I interest you in some information?" "We got all sorts of stuff here," and "Thanks for stopping by." Perfect for in-game marketplaces and interactions. Observations: Enrich your storytelling with observational comments like "I think I heard something," "It's dark in here," and "This place is beautiful." These lines help characters react naturally to their environment. Questions: Add curiosity and interaction with probing questions such as "Can you help me?" "What do you need?" and "Is that all you've got?" Ideal for creating engaging dialogues and quest prompts. Statements: Enhance emotional depth and character backstories with lines like "For honor and for glory," "I got your back," and "Victory is ours." These statements are perfect for motivational moments, battle cries, or casual conversations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elevate your voice-driven projects with the Voices: Short Phrases pack. Each line is meticulously designed for seamless integration, ensuring an immersive auditory experience that adds personality and realism to your characters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please refer to our Terms of Service to understand our attribution policy for our Voices packs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;44.1kHz/16bit&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each file is loaded with metadata tags to reduce time searching for lines.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="voices_wordlessexpressionsvoiceoverpack"&gt;&lt;a id="voices_wordlessexpressionsvoiceoverpack" href="https://youtu.be/rkeOf-mdVQ4"&gt;Voices: Wordless Expressions Voice Over Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/05c7b4220658366c1d74dc62b40319b82af4da66.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=336e52f555009feebdd603af2bd25f7a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click here to view the full list of voice lines in the Voices: Wordless Expressions Pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enhance your characters’ emotional depth with the Voices: Wordless Expressions pack by Ovani Sound. This unique collection features verbal gestures and non-verbal sounds, recorded by professional voice actors Bryce Garland, D'laina Hunt, Serina Moonshine, Hannah Weeks, Michael Smith, Simoné Oosthuizen, and Stefanie Wolfes - ensuring authentic, natural performances, and not AI or computer-generated voices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With a total of 170 finely crafted voice lines, this pack is organized into key categories across multiple performers:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Attack and Effort Sounds: The largest category, featuring a wide array of grunts, yells, and exertion noises. Whether it's intense combat, heavy lifting, or pushing through tough situations, these sounds provide the raw energy needed for action-packed scenes. Each actor contributes multiple variations, ensuring versatility for different scenarios. Pain and Struggle Sounds: Capture the distress and physical strain of characters with numerous pain grunts, cries, and struggle sounds. These are perfect for conveying injuries, combat damage, and moments of endurance under stress, adding realism and intensity to your characters' experiences. Annoyed, Taunting, and Flirtatious Sounds: Express irritation, playful mockery, and light-hearted interactions with a range of sighs, scoffs, taunts, and flirtatious giggles. These sounds bring out the personality in your characters, whether they're teasing, provoking, or engaging in more intimate moments. Breaths, Gasps, and Sighs: Immerse players in high-stress or emotional situations with varied breath sounds, gasps of surprise, and deep sighs. These vocal gestures enhance scenes where characters are reacting to danger, relief, or exhaustion. Laughs and Joyful Sounds: Lighten the mood with an assortment of laughs, chuckles, and joyful expressions. These sounds are perfect for adding warmth and charm to your characters, making them feel more relatable and alive. Miscellaneous Expressions: Includes a selection of other non-verbal sounds such as coughing, throat clearing, drowning, and emerging from water. These additional cues are ideal for specific situational needs, adding extra layers of realism to your scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elevate your voice-driven projects with the Voices: Wordless Expressions pack. Each sound is meticulously designed for seamless integration, ensuring an immersive auditory experience that transcends language barriers, making it a versatile choice for any project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please refer to our Terms of Service to understand our attribution policy for our Voices packs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;44.1kHz/16bit&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each file is loaded with metadata tags to reduce time searching for lines.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="yourvoiceactor_brycegarlandvoiceoverpack"&gt;&lt;a id="yourvoiceactor_brycegarlandvoiceoverpack" href="https://youtu.be/U4X6fE4sU0g"&gt;Your Voice Actor: Bryce Garland Voice Over Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click here to view the full list of voice lines in the Bryce Garland Voice Over Pack&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fully voice any character with the Bryce Garland Voice Over Pack by Ovani Sound. Featuring over 600 professionally recorded voice lines, this pack provides a versatile range of tones and expressions, perfect for giving life to an otherwise silent male character! No AI used, 100% Human voice recordings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Categories Included: Accepting, Confirming, &amp;amp; Thanks – Kind, neutral, and rude variations for affirmation and gratitude. Battle &amp;amp; Support Yells – Intense callouts and combat shouts for action-packed scenes. Commands – Tactical and situational instructions in far and near variations. Declining &amp;amp; Confrontational – Polite refusals to strong dismissals for complex interactions. General Comments – Relatable phrases like “Gross” and “What now” to add personality. Greetings &amp;amp; Farewells – Friendly and dismissive greetings and goodbyes. Puzzling – Lines for exploration and problem-solving scenarios